== Trivia ==
* The item is a reference to a flash game Edmund McMillen created in 2005 called ''Grey-Matter''. In this game, enemies would be killed in a fashion identical to Dark Arts.
* Before being added in game, [https://foursouls.com/cards/fsp2-dark_arts Dark Arts] was the starting item for Black Judas in ''The Binding of Isaac: Four Souls'', a card game created by Edmund McMillen.

